      <slug></slug>
      <title>PostgreSQL Clustering with Red Hat Cluster Suite</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>PostgreSQL Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Red Hat Cluster Suite is a robust technology that is used at many areas.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;PostgreSQL can be directly used with Red Hat Cluster Suite, in order to create an active-passive clustering environment.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this session, we will setup a two-node cluster, learn how to configure it, also talk about some more details.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="3281">Devrim Gündüz</person>
      </persons>
